 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZxyfK5RfIXAQ7kNvwHmkb5E&_nc_oc=Adpjqzz1FPC08XTkm7MLWfj_tdNovtls_iRs9N_VbJORnvPlzUFUBYPI7lALpM_vNTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOtiCfky1pJ4fYogqDjzk474Qfft9ffAeRp_Gju7Y1MqQ&oe=6AE4B541"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQpclQDI61oQ7kNvwGCVbRm&_nc_oc=AdoRunlq9wF10owUu1PKyrJRSV9XX-nVpn5SDttPySfONs3WjG5Nr6h6DuXvR_1srWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOuQk0xQRXk3ksktvlB2wmWB8AjiICjtJhDNj6EtuGRcg&oe=6AE48A66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ei6739YDHvwQ7kNvwH7Q9Ic&_nc_oc=Adocn5flbOeVv0CRHuQ0C8iIL-uJP1TKl_zB_JInsWFVsGHIhAQsusg-YnyPCDh771A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOvIIYqKBYiMclrD5fTXRJfdCpJ2qUkxCXuz17bOdZfcw&oe=6AE4945C"}, {"fil